#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-AD0320 expect=skipped domain=ADSLX
#note "SCOPE-GATE skip: SUBJECT LEVEL ANALYSIS DATASET is derived from an EXACT dataset name of ADSL, never from a prefix, so ADSLX is not it; the declared structure BDS is outside Scope.Data_Structures.Include [SUBJECT LEVEL ANALYSIS DATASET]. The label is deliberately wrong, so the rule would fire if the gate ever admitted an ADSL-prefixed name."
#library standard=adamig version=1-3
dataset ADSLX structure=BDS label="Wrong Label"
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col PARAMCD type=Char
col AVAL    type=Num
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | HEIGHT | 175
